+# Batch 45 authoring notes — Supersymmetric EFT Operators and Thresholds
+
+Run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23  
+Pair: aqft-susy-effective-theories / aqft-susy-effective-theories-examples
+
